title: "The Contract Is the Work"
excerpt: "How contract-as-spec turns agentic execution from a chain of plausible outputs into governed, inspectable work whose decisions can be reconstructed."
date: 2026-08-25
readTime: "13 min"
contentType: essay
category: "Agentic SDLC"
