  - "delivery-systems"
status: published
heroImage: "/assets/posts/the-contract-is-the-work/hero-maturity-model.svg"
whyItMatters: "Agentic handoffs fail silently when no durable object binds intent, evidence, and decision authority together; teams discover the gap only after a chain of confident-looking work turns out to answer the wrong question."
leaderTakeaway: "Make the Feature Contract the object of record, not the prompt or the final summary. Require explicit acceptance criteria, named evidence obligations, and a named decision authority before execution begins, and treat any change to those terms as a visible amendment rather than an implementation choice."
