The four vendor footnotes still say verification pending.

Replace them with the researched, scoped statements:

- GitHub `gh skill`: public preview.
- JFrog: available registry, optional/tier-dependent signing, Preview boundary on relevant local enforcement.
- Red Hat: separate Agent Catalog / MCP Catalog roles and pre-GA boundaries.
- MCP Registry: preview metadata/discovery service.

Do not leave `to verify` comments in the publication candidate.

