---
/**
 * RelatedWork — one always-visible sentence placing this piece among
 * adjacent work, plus a `<details>` disclosure listing 2-4 citations.
 * Citations are data the caller supplies; this component never invents
 * one — sourcing them from the essay's prior-art/sources research files
 * is the manuscript leg's job, not this component's.
 */
