[^bom-scope]: September 16, 2026 lab audit, source-path inspection: bundle materialization attempts automatic BOM emission; the separate plain single-artifact deployment path emits activity events without invoking that generator. This is the audit's scoped result, not a fresh runtime probe or a measured fleet-wide adoption rate. Internal identifiers withheld; method only.
[^context-records]: September 16, 2026 lab audit: three context-provenance rows inspected in the canonical checkout, containing real deployed-artifact drift findings. The CLI-to-writer call chain was traced, but the inspected durable records did not identify the actor that produced those rows. File modification time is not used as a per-row execution timestamp. This context record is separate from the still-designed just-in-time provisioning record. Internal identifiers withheld; method only.
